{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/9baa54dc2defcf1c5d91157d4c5a8e89.avif?t=1773411522\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras_big/9baa54dc2defcf1c5d91157d4c5a8e89.avif?t=1773411522 width=1560 height=600 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SKYLARK</strong> <i>&quot;Hope is earned \u2014 one day at a time.&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sky used to be clean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't remember it that way. But somewhere in the static of a broken radio, a voice does \u2014 and it's calling you forward. So you fly. Into clouds that glow the wrong color. Into silence that hides something worth finding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You follow the signal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/f126663df324a0df2a0fcef949d9c08e.poster.avif?t=1773411522\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/f126663df324a0df2a0fcef949d9c08e.webm?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/f126663df324a0df2a0fcef949d9c08e.mp4?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAIL A WORLD THAT'S STILL BREATHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the helm of your airship and drift through a world wrapped in toxic haze and quiet beauty. Each flight uncovers something new \u2014 a crumbling city frozen in amber air, a snow-capped peak piercing through the poison, a faint signal buried in the noise that might just change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is broken. But it hasn't stopped being beautiful. And it's yours to explore.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/b2a302ecf0d35f5041b31d7ce8894168.poster.avif?t=1773411522\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/b2a302ecf0d35f5041b31d7ce8894168.webm?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/b2a302ecf0d35f5041b31d7ce8894168.mp4?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE, ONE DAY AT A TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing comes free up here. Ration fuel, food, and medicine with care. Run quick-handed minigames to scavenge what you need from the ruins below. Every supply matters. Every choice echoes forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each expedition pushes you a little further \u2014 and each return brings something back with you. Relics. Knowledge. A reason to try again.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/a6d8bea9f0a97ea9aa54e1214fa45141.poster.avif?t=1773411522\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/a6d8bea9f0a97ea9aa54e1214fa45141.webm?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/a6d8bea9f0a97ea9aa54e1214fa45141.mp4?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND THE MUSIC THE WORLD LEFT BEHIND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered through forgotten places are cassette tapes \u2014 songs from a world that used to sing. Collect them, slot them in, and let your own curated soundtrack carry you through the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every playthrough sounds different. Every tape is a small act of remembering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/7bcae0088c3ba4ff26d3f28f4216ed3b.poster.avif?t=1773411522\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/7bcae0088c3ba4ff26d3f28f4216ed3b.webm?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/7bcae0088c3ba4ff26d3f28f4216ed3b.mp4?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GATHER YOUR CREW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't last long alone. As you follow the signals, you'll find them \u2014 survivors, outcasts, and wanderers, each waiting for someone to show up.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pathfinder</strong> \u2014 an irrepressibly cheerful cat who reads the wind like a book and never runs out of encouragement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medic</strong> \u2014 a brilliant, awkward scientist who speaks in footnotes and cares more than she lets on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Builder</strong> \u2014 a quiet alien sage who mends the ship with patience and speaks in metaphors drawn from the stars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operator</strong> \u2014 a sharp-eyed tactician, all composure on the surface, all heart underneath</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scout</strong> \u2014 a small, loyal robot still searching for someone named Anna</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each one carries a story. Each one changes yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/db900749fe4a972ef03b869aa76dc47b.poster.avif?t=1773411522\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/db900749fe4a972ef03b869aa76dc47b.webm?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/db900749fe4a972ef03b869aa76dc47b.mp4?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTHING IS WASTED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SKYLARK rewards those who persist. Collect relics across runs that carry forward \u2014 proof that every attempt matters, even the ones that fall short. The world may reset, but you don't. You remember. You adapt. You reach further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because some skies are worth fighting for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/cc1a3b3b838e83e1895f5f2f656a9c65.poster.avif?t=1773411522\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/cc1a3b3b838e83e1895f5f2f656a9c65.webm?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/cc1a3b3b838e83e1895f5f2f656a9c65.mp4?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy survival adventure</strong> \u2014 explore a beautifully poisoned open sky</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite progression</strong> \u2014 collect relics to grow stronger across runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hands-on resource gathering</strong> \u2014 minigame-based scavenging and survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cassette tape collection</strong> \u2014 discover songs and build your own in-flight playlist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A crew that matters</strong> \u2014 five distinct companions, each with personality, story, and purpose</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Radio-driven narrative</strong> \u2014 follow signals, intercept transmissions, uncover the truth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story about hope</strong> \u2014 warm, bittersweet, and worth the journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/7dd9d5d54107fc37ef1698d51d9fd31c.poster.avif?t=1773411522\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/7dd9d5d54107fc37ef1698d51d9fd31c.webm?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/7dd9d5d54107fc37ef1698d51d9fd31c.mp4?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/2f877262f799f5413b852acd0b60eb41.poster.avif?t=1773411522\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/2f877262f799f5413b852acd0b60eb41.webm?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/2f877262f799f5413b852acd0b60eb41.mp4?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>&quot;Hope is earned \u2014 one day at a time.&quot;</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SKYLARK</strong> \u2014 Coming soon to Steam. <strong>[Wishlist Now]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a9 Skywonder Games</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3397050?t=1773411522","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773411522","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/6fffbb79d26e839f912356bf8523ff5c13ac3eec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773411522","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/6fffbb79d26e839f912356bf8523ff5c13ac3eec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773411522","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/9baa54dc2defcf1c5d91157d4c5a8e89.avif?t=1773411522\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras_big/9baa54dc2defcf1c5d91157d4c5a8e89.avif?t=1773411522 width=1560 height=600 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SKYLARK</strong> <i>&quot;Hope is earned \u2014 one day at a time.&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sky used to be clean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't remember it that way. But somewhere in the static of a broken radio, a voice does \u2014 and it's calling you forward. So you fly. Into clouds that glow the wrong color. Into silence that hides something worth finding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You follow the signal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/f126663df324a0df2a0fcef949d9c08e.poster.avif?t=1773411522\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/f126663df324a0df2a0fcef949d9c08e.webm?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/f126663df324a0df2a0fcef949d9c08e.mp4?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAIL A WORLD THAT'S STILL BREATHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the helm of your airship and drift through a world wrapped in toxic haze and quiet beauty. Each flight uncovers something new \u2014 a crumbling city frozen in amber air, a snow-capped peak piercing through the poison, a faint signal buried in the noise that might just change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is broken. But it hasn't stopped being beautiful. And it's yours to explore.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/b2a302ecf0d35f5041b31d7ce8894168.poster.avif?t=1773411522\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/b2a302ecf0d35f5041b31d7ce8894168.webm?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/b2a302ecf0d35f5041b31d7ce8894168.mp4?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE, ONE DAY AT A TIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing comes free up here. Ration fuel, food, and medicine with care. Run quick-handed minigames to scavenge what you need from the ruins below. Every supply matters. Every choice echoes forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each expedition pushes you a little further \u2014 and each return brings something back with you. Relics. Knowledge. A reason to try again.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/a6d8bea9f0a97ea9aa54e1214fa45141.poster.avif?t=1773411522\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/a6d8bea9f0a97ea9aa54e1214fa45141.webm?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/a6d8bea9f0a97ea9aa54e1214fa45141.mp4?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND THE MUSIC THE WORLD LEFT BEHIND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered through forgotten places are cassette tapes \u2014 songs from a world that used to sing. Collect them, slot them in, and let your own curated soundtrack carry you through the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every playthrough sounds different. Every tape is a small act of remembering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/7bcae0088c3ba4ff26d3f28f4216ed3b.poster.avif?t=1773411522\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/7bcae0088c3ba4ff26d3f28f4216ed3b.webm?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/7bcae0088c3ba4ff26d3f28f4216ed3b.mp4?t=1773411522\" type=