 \u2014 proof that every attempt matters, even the ones that fall short. The world may reset, but you don't. You remember. You adapt. You reach further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because some skies are worth fighting for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/cc1a3b3b838e83e1895f5f2f656a9c65.poster.avif?t=1773411522\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/cc1a3b3b838e83e1895f5f2f656a9c65.webm?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397050/extras/cc1a3b3b838e83e1895f5f2f656a9c65.mp4?t=1773411522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy survival adventure</strong> \u2014 explore a beautifully poisoned open sky</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite progression</strong> \u2014 collect relics to grow stronger across runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hands-on resource gathering</strong> \u2014 minigame-based scavenging and survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cassette tape collection</strong> \u2014 discover songs and build your own in-flight playlist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A crew that matters</strong> \u2014 five distinct companions, each with personality, story, and purpose</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Radio-driven narrative</strong> \u2014 follow signals, intercept transmissions, uncover the truth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story about hope</strong> \u2014 warm, bittersweet, and worth the journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video c